          "id": "2117686575098450418",
          "type": "original",
          "timestamp": "2026-11-03T18:33:18.000Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/EdwardJDavey/status/2117686575098450418",
          "textSnippet": "The work isn’t done. We will hold the government’s feet to the fire to make sure they follow through and do this properly, so disabled young people like Mikey – and their parents and carers – can access their Child Trust Funds without pointless costs and bureaucracy."
